      "original_record": "before",
      "value": "Solve the following system of linear equations by finding the inverse of the coefficient matrix:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-3+z=0 \\\\ 5y-1+3x=2z+1 \\\\ 3z+2x-1=2y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFind  $x+y+z.$",
